  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Trauma Mental Health Services of the Ahfad Trauma Centre at the Ahfad University for Women. This project will address gaps in provision of mental health support services in Khartoum, White Nile and Gedaref states through rehabilitation of facilities, hiring of new counselors and a therapist, training and production of IEC material.?</narrative>
